    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39232" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιδια-τίθημι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>arrange besides</i> or <i>afterwards</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				62.15
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, <i>deposit as security for</i> one's doing a given
			act, <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				110
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀργύριον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					33.13
				</span></i>
			; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιδιαθήκη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11
				</span></i>
			; also, <i>stake</i>
			<i>on</i> a throw at dice, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				9.96
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιδιάκειμαι</span>.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>. 
				Med.
			, <i>make</i>
			<i>a second</i> or <i>later will, Pap.Erzherzog Rainer</i><i><span class="en">
				723
			</span></i> (ined., cf. Kreller <i><span class="en">
				<u>Erbrechtl.Untersuch.</u>
				p.298
			</span></i>).</div>
